          "filename": "Myinkaba Gubyaukgyi, Pagan 0132.jpg",
          "caption": "East entrance of the temple. Restored frontage and chattravalis are evident in this photograph; there is a missing pediment that has not been replaced. The corner finials are large and massive, compared to earlier temples. Inside the temple are some of the best murals in Pagan, including an action-filled Defeat of Mara.",
